 hasAgentRole).</rdfs:comment>    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.example.org/ontology#AgentRole"/>    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.example.org/ontology#RoleAssignment"/>    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.example.org/ontology#hasAgentRole"/>  </rdf:Description>  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.example.org/ontology#hasPrice">    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>    <rdfs:label>has price</rdfs:label>    <rdfs:comment>Links a LineItem to its Price.</rdfs:comment>    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.example.org/ontology#LineItem"/>    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.example.org/ontology#Price"/>  </rdf:Description>  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.example.org/ontology#InvoiceHeader">    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>    <rdfs:label>Invoice Header</rdfs:label>    <rdfs:comment>The header section of an invoice, containing document dates and reference numbers.</rdfs:comment>    <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="http://www.example.org/ontology#InvoiceDetail"/>    <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="http://www.example.org/ontology#InvoiceSummary"/>  </rdf:Description>  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.example.org/ontology#RoleAssignment">    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>    <rdfs:label>Role Assignment</rdfs:label>    <rdfs:comment>A pivot class linking an Organization to an AgentRole within an InvoiceMessage.</rdfs:comment>    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:nodeID="n13b9ca7f1e684acfba1b57fd07842a50b12"/>  </rdf:Description>  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.example.org/ontology#simpleElementOf">    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>    <rdfs:label>is simple element of composite</rdfs:label>    <rdfs:comment>Links a SimpleDataElement to the CompositeDataElement it is part of (inverse of hasSimpleElement).</rdfs:com